						<tr>
							<td height="50" colspan="3" valign="top" class="windowbg2" align="left">The venue for this ended up being right down the street from where I live!<br /><br />It was interesting being that it was my first time seeing the guys out of the &quot;home turf&quot; so to speak. This was the first time I looked out into the audience and saw people standing with their arms crossed kinda like &quot;ok who are these guys&quot;... but of course once Saba dropped the beat and Geo opened his mouth they had everyone. <br /><br />I was mad I had to split right after their set to go finish my homework though lol.<br /><br />Two videos I took:<br /><br /><object width="425" height="350"><param name="movie" value="http://www.youtube.com/v/9eVClCWj2qI"></param><param name="wmode" value="tramsparent"><embed src="http://www.youtube.com/v/9eVClCWj2qI" type="application/x-shockwave-flash" wmode="transparent" width="425" height="350"></embed></object><br /><br />&quot;Man, if you went to high school in the 90&#039;s you better remember this song...&quot; hahahaha<br /><br /><object width="425" height="350"><param name="movie" value="http://www.youtube.com/v/5W6IZDPsWXI"></param><param name="wmode" value="tramsparent"><embed src="http://www.youtube.com/v/5W6IZDPsWXI" type="application/x-shockwave-flash" wmode="transparent" width="425" height="350"></embed></object><br /><br />Nice job guys, was good seeing you out here...<br /></td>
