						<tr>
							<td height="50" colspan="3" valign="top" class="windowbg2" align="left">I was never a big candy or sweets in general kid, but the one thing I&#039;ve ALWAYS had a soft spot for is ice cream. I LOVE ice cream and all incarnations of it - milkshakes, ice cream cake, everything. Ben &amp; Jerrys has creative flavors, I appreciate that. The classics like Haagen Daz do their job well. But my favorite is Tillamook ice cream, love to support the homegrown even in the dairy department! <br /><br />Also over here in New York they&#039;ve got a little cafe in the bottom floor of Bloomingdales department store called 40 Carats....its been there since I was a baby, before I moved out west, and they serve their world famous frozen yogurt which is incredible....</td>
						</tr>
